WEBVTT

00:00:00.690 --> 00:00:05.935
In the year 755, An Lushan launched a rebellion at Fanyang, and the flames of war spread rapidly south.

00:00:10.674 --> 00:00:16.653
The aging Emperor Xuanzong had no choice but to flee Chang'an at dawn with his beloved consort, escaping south.

00:00:20.697 --> 00:00:25.301
When the procession reached Mawei Slope, the soldiers angrily halted and refused to go any farther.

00:00:30.748 --> 00:00:34.740
The furious soldiers killed Yang Guozhong, and his official's hat fell to the ground.

00:00:40.720 --> 00:00:45.116
The troops also demanded that Yang Guifei be put to death, and Xuanzong, tears in his eyes, agreed.

00:00:50.720 --> 00:00:55.339
The Mawei Slope Incident became the most tragic chapter in the story of Xuanzong and his consort.
